# runekit-reforged
===
 Alt1-compatible toolkit for RuneScape 3 on Linux. Run clue solvers, XP trackers, AFK alerts, and other Alt1 apps alongside the official RS3 client. Reforged from the original RuneKit —         rebuilt with Python 3.12, Qt6, and modern dependencies for a stable experience on current Linux distros. No game client modification required.
===
